  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="9cca0a8e-9e22-5996-8c68-f23eade69fee" activityNameId="75802165-c276-5002-991e-506de11d4a9d" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Heat, at groundwater heat pump, brine-water, 50kW, for district heating, CH electr.</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Heat, at groundwater heat pump, brine-water, 50kW, for district heating, CH electr.
Heat from a brine-water heat pump, 50kW with heat source form ground water and Swiss electricity mix (CH). Lifetime of the heating system is 20 years. SPF=3.1. Loss of coolant is 2% (of the total amount in the system) per year. 
UUID: 39abc2b1-3d46-3123-9bf7-6519e0083ba5
Included are the share of the production of the brine-water heatpump with a lifetime of 20years scaled for 1MJ. Also the  the groundwater delivery and return with a lifetime of 20 years is part of this process. 
The use of Swiss electricity mix (CH) is calculated by the  SPF of 3.1 for producing district heat (60° flow temperature).
Also the loss of coolant (2% in a year) is included.
There are NO end of life processes included. Only the deposit of waste during the construction or usephase are included.
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland.
Technology: 
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: 
Sampling: heat efficieny based on literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_39abc2b1-3d46-3123-9bf7-6519e0083ba5.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
